# A secret this library will not work around — absent, or present but too short — is the first
# configuration mistake most teams meet, so both halves of it are worth a startup message that says
# what to set rather than a bean-creation stack trace.
org.springframework.boot.diagnostics.FailureAnalyzer=\
ch.raph.datamask.spring.MissingMaskSecretFailureAnalyzer,\
ch.raph.datamask.spring.ShortMaskSecretFailureAnalyzer
